          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">College of Veterinary Medicine & Biomedical Sciences Image Collection</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This collection highlights over 100 years of the changing face of the people, technology, and facilities of the College of Veterinary Medicine & Biomedical Sciences</p>
