          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Live to Build a Better World: Despair, Survival, and Hope in Science Fiction’s Response to Environmental Change</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This digital collection reflects the content of an exhibit presented at Cushing Memorial Library & Archives from January - June 2021</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
