            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/538%2Fimage-bibliography-105a8e82-34d1-4ddf-94cf-590f2b9a6bab.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Bibliography of Science Fiction and Fantasy Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Bibliography of Science Fiction and Fantasy</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This bibliographic control of Science Fiction and Fantasy has a long and storied history, from its beginnings in the 1930s to the online tools of today</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h3>Chapman Texas Collection</h3>
      <div class="tamu-cards-grid">
        <a href="/austin-map-texas" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/aef%2Fimage-texas-map-c400fd83-9c24-4b11-a205-b9a34461ede4.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Stephen F. Austin 1830 Map of Texas Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Stephen F. Austin's 1830 Map of Texas</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This first edition of Stephen F. Austin’s 1830 Map of Texas is often described as “the first meaningful map of Texas” and was the first to accurately depict the rivers in Texas and illustrate many of the early settlements including Brazoria, Gonzales, Harrisburg, Matagorda, Victoria and Waco Village</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/owens-folk-music" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/855%2Fimage-owens-352e61fe-4c56-4461-9caf-d2edd4142f8e.png/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Owens Folk Music Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Owens Folk Music</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">Contains sound recordings made by William A. Owens during the late 1930s to early 1940s, during which time he was a professor of English at the Agricultural & Mechanical College of Texas</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/gray-diary" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/855%2Fimage-owens-352e61fe-4c56-4461-9caf-d2edd4142f8e.png/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="William Fairfax Gray Portrait"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">William Fairfax Gray Diary</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">William Fairfax Gray’s diary offers one of the most vivid firsthand accounts of the founding of the Republic of Texas, capturing both the political turbulence of the Convention of 1836 and the human experiences behind it</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/stripling-architecture" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/e01%2Fimage-stripling-f12943c6-0fc4-40b0-8596-d93ee430970f.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Stripling Architecture Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Raiford Leak Stripling Architecture Collection</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This collection is made up of over 250 projects contained in 24 boxes, as well as drawings and construction documents housed in flat files in one map case</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/cuny-intertect" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/b25%2Fimage-cuny-a7a584e7-0239-4401-8664-4fbe964cc531.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Frederick Cuny/INTERTECT Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Frederick C. Cuny/INTERTECT Collection</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">Contains the working library, office files, press clippings, slides, photographs and Beta and VHS tapes of Cuny and his team at the disaster relief/response firm, Intertect, and at the non-profit organization he co-founded in 1987, the Intertect Institute</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/150-years-and-counting" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/b5c%2Fimage-lamar-1-9966249d-ed7c-4fa9-b247-82d271682ec1.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="150 Years and Counting Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">150 Years and Counting: Celebrating 150 Years of the City of Bryan, Texas</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This digital exhibit highlights the architecture and growth of the city, from a rural settlement to a flourishing city and seat of Brazos County</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/contreras-griffin-nasa-av-recordings" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/d09%2Fimage-nasa-a2c94f16-341d-4d64-acb5-97aef9a3c51d.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Contreras Griffin NASA Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Hernán Contreras and Gerald Griffin Collection of NASA A/V Recordings</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">Contains digitized video and audio from the Hernán Contreras ’62 Collection of NASA Events Film Reels and the Gerald D. “Gerry” Griffin ’56 Collection of NASA Video and Audio Recordings</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/minutes-houston-oil-company" class="tamu-card">
          <div class="tamu-card__image">
            <img src="https://digitalcollections.library.tamu.edu/iiif/2/8b4%2Fimage-houston-4cded8ea-1f05-44a8-97af-aa3d9ff28d17.jpg/full/400,/0/default.jpg" alt="Houston Oil Minutes Thumbnail"/>
          </div>
          <div class="tamu-card__body">
            <h3 class="tamu-card__title">Minutes of the Houston Oil Company</h3>
            <p class="tamu-card__description">This minute book - one volume, 299 pages - encompasses the first eight years of the Houston Oil Company’s business</p>
            <span class="tamu-card__link">View collection</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

